<title>USA: Kaye Group Inc Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Kaye Group Inc Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000s except per share)</p>
<p>					 THREE MONTHS    NINE MONTHS</p>
<p>					1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>							 (A)  (Restated)(B)</p>
<p>Income before charge, in lieu of income</p>
